## Interface: 16001
## Title: BetterFishingForever
## Notes: Double right-click in the world to cast Fishing on WoW Forever, while a fishing pole is equipped. Shift + double right-click swaps the pole in or out. Optional Fishing 1-300 route with map pins and a GPS arrow. /bfish
